# Structure

```
src/
  app/          routes, Shell, layout
  catalogue/    contact sheet, plates, detail
  playground/   editor, drafts, export
  harness/      composeSrcDoc, PreviewFrame, ControlStrip
  prompt/       buildPrompt, CopyButton
  specimens/    one folder per specimen + index.ts
  styles/       tokens.css, base.css
docs/           design-spec.md
public/         _redirects, _headers, favicon
```

## Registry

- Specimens register in an **explicit array** in `src/specimens/index.ts`.
- Adding a specimen = add a folder + one import + one array entry.
- No dynamic `import.meta.glob`, no magic directory scanning for catalogue content.
- Refs (`SPX-001`, …) and order stay under human control.
